/F2 15 Tf
(5. Limitations and Next Steps) Tj
T*
T*
/F1 11 Tf
(This report has several limitations that should be considered before using its results:) Tj
T*
(Short period: only twelve months of data were collected, so long-term capacity fade is) Tj
T*
(uncertain.) Tj
T*
(Single site and mild year: the results come from one campus, and the 2025 winter was) Tj
T*
(milder than average, so they may not transfer to the second campus.) Tj
T*
(Maintenance cost: the cost figures exclude the maintenance contract of USD 8,000 per) Tj
T*
(year. Including it, the simple payback period would be about 9.8 years \(520,000 /) Tj
T*
(53,000\).) Tj
T*
(No environmental assessment: no life-cycle environmental assessment of the batteries was) Tj
T*
(carried out.) Tj
T*
(Supplier figures: the specifications in Table 1 are example values from supplier quotes) Tj
T*
(in this synthetic scenario, not independent laboratory tests.) Tj
T*
(Next steps: the college will collect a second year of data in 2026 before deciding) Tj
T*
(whether to install the same system at its second campus.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
